[{"id":"fm-core1-1.36-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>Describe the following linear transformations:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}7&amp;0\\\\0&amp;7\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;5\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}10&amp;0\\\\0&amp;20\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac13&amp;0\\\\0&amp;\\frac13\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Stretch, parallel to the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis, scale factor 2.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Enlargement, centred at the origin, scale factor 7.  Alternative Method:  Stretch, parallel to the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis, scale factor 7, and a stretch, parallel to the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis, scale factor 7.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>Stretch, parallel to the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis, scale factor 5.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p>Stretch, parallel to the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis, scale factor 10, and a stretch, parallel to the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis, scale factor 20.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><p>Enlargement, centred at the origin, scale factor <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac13\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.  Alternative Method:  Stretch, parallel to the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis, scale factor <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac13\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and a stretch, parallel to the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis, scale factor <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac13\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.36-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>The matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> represents an enlargement, centred at the origin, scale factor 2.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Write down the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A^3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A^{15}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A^2=\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;0\\\\0&amp;4\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A^3=\\begin{pmatrix}8&amp;0\\\\0&amp;8\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A^{15}=\\begin{pmatrix}32768&amp;0\\\\0&amp;32768\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.36-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>A shape with area 4 is mapped to its image by the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Write down the area of the shape’s image.</p>","steps":["<p>The matrix represents a stretch, parallel to the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis, scale factor 3. So the image will be <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3\\times\" data-display=\"false\"></span> the area of the original shape. So the area of the shape’s image is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3\\times4=12\" data-display=\"false\"></span> units<span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.36-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>A shape with area 4 is mapped to its image by the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;0\\\\0&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Write down the area of the shape’s image.</p>","steps":["<p>The matrix represents an enlargement, centred at the origin, scale factor 3. So the image will be <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3^2\\times\" data-display=\"false\"></span> the area of the original shape. So the area of the shape’s image is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3^2\\times4=36\" data-display=\"false\"></span> units<span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.36-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>The triangle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has vertices at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-2,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,9)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(4,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. The matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;0\\\\0&amp;4\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> maps <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to the triangle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T'\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find the coordinates of the vertices and area of the triangle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T'\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;0\\\\0&amp;4\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-2&amp;0&amp;4\\\\0&amp;9&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-8&amp;0&amp;16\\\\0&amp;36&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>The coordinates of the vertices of triangle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\\prime\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-8,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,36)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(16,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.  The area of the triangle is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"=\\frac12\\times24\\times36=432\" data-display=\"false\"></span> units<span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.36-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>Write down the matrix that represents each of the following linear transformations:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Stretch, parallel to the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis, scale factor 9.</p></li><li><p>Enlargement, centred at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, scale factor 15.</p></li><li><p>Stretch, parallel to the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis, scale factor <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac23\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Stretch, parallel to the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis, scale factor 6, and a stretch, parallel to the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis, scale factor 2.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}9&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}15&amp;0\\\\0&amp;15\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;\\frac23\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}6&amp;0\\\\0&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.36-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>Write down the matrix that represents a stretch that maps:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(1,2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(1,4)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(4,-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(12,-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(16,9)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(16,3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(25,-2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(5,-2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(8,-7)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(8,-3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-30,5)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-18,5)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;k\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\4\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\2k\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\4\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2k=4\\Rightarrow k=2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}k&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}4\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}12\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}4k\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}12\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"4k=12\\Rightarrow k=3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;k\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}16\\\\9\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}16\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}16\\\\9k\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}16\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"9k=3\\Rightarrow k=\\frac13\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;\\frac13\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}k&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}25\\\\-2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}5\\\\-2\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}25k\\\\-2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}5\\\\-2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"25k=5\\Rightarrow k=\\frac15\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac15&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;k\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}8\\\\-7\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}8\\\\-3\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}8\\\\-7k\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}8\\\\-3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"-7k=-3\\Rightarrow k=\\frac37\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;\\frac37\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">f)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}k&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-30\\\\5\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-18\\\\5\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}-30k\\\\5\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-18\\\\5\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"-30k=-18\\Rightarrow k=\\frac35\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac35&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.36-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>Write down the matrix that represents an enlargement about the origin that maps:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2,5)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(8,20)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-240,90)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-48,18)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(20,600)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(64,1920)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-360,-440)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-342,-418)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}k&amp;0\\\\0&amp;k\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\5\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}8\\\\20\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}2k\\\\5k\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}8\\\\20\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2k=8\\Rightarrow k=4\\qquad 5k=20\\Rightarrow k=4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;0\\\\0&amp;4\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}k&amp;0\\\\0&amp;k\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-240\\\\90\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-48\\\\18\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}-240k\\\\90k\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-48\\\\18\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"-240k=-48\\Rightarrow k=\\frac15\\qquad 90k=18\\Rightarrow k=\\frac15\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac15&amp;0\\\\0&amp;\\frac15\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}k&amp;0\\\\0&amp;k\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}20\\\\600\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}64\\\\1920\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}20k\\\\600k\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}64\\\\1920\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"20k=64\\Rightarrow k=\\frac{16}{5}\\qquad 600k=1920\\Rightarrow k=\\frac{16}{5}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac{16}{5}&amp;0\\\\0&amp;\\frac{16}{5}\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}k&amp;0\\\\0&amp;k\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-360\\\\-440\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-342\\\\-418\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}-360k\\\\-440k\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-342\\\\-418\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"-360k=-342\\Rightarrow k=\\frac{19}{20}\\qquad -440k=-418\\Rightarrow k=\\frac{19}{20}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac{19}{20}&amp;0\\\\0&amp;\\frac{19}{20}\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.36-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>The triangle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has vertices at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A(4,3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B(8,3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C(7,9)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as shown in the diagram below.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.36/questions/assets/diagrams/136-q9.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the area of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is mapped to triangle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"V\" data-display=\"false\"></span> by the transformation associated with the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}5&amp;0\\\\0&amp;12\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find the vertices of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"V\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and hence find its area.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Area of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T=\\frac12\\times(8-4)\\times(9-3)=\\frac12\\times4\\times6=12\" data-display=\"false\"></span> units<span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}5&amp;0\\\\0&amp;12\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;8&amp;7\\\\3&amp;3&amp;9\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}20&amp;40&amp;35\\\\36&amp;36&amp;108\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\\prime(20,36)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\\prime(40,36)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\\prime(35,108)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.  Area of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"V=\\frac12\\times(40-20)\\times(108-36)=\\frac12\\times20\\times72=720\" data-display=\"false\"></span> units<span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.  Alternative Method (using determinants):  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left|\\begin{matrix}5&amp;0\\\\0&amp;12\\end{matrix}\\right|=5\\times12-0\\times0=60\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.  Area of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"V=60\\times\" data-display=\"false\"></span> Area of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T=60\\times12=720\" data-display=\"false\"></span> units<span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.36-q10","number":10,"question":"<p>The kite <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"K\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has vertices at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,-5)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-1,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(1,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"K\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is mapped to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"K'\" data-display=\"false\"></span> by an enlargement about the origin, such that the area of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"K\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is doubled. Find the exact coordinates of the vertices of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"K'\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Area of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"K=\\frac12\\times2\\times2+\\frac12\\times2\\times5=7\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}a&amp;0\\\\0&amp;a\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;-1&amp;0&amp;1\\\\-5&amp;0&amp;2&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;-a&amp;0&amp;a\\\\-5a&amp;0&amp;2a&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Area of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"K\\prime=\\frac12\\times2a\\times2a+\\frac12\\times2a\\times5a=7a^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"7a^2=2\\times7\\Rightarrow a^2=2\\Rightarrow a=\\sqrt2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"K\\prime\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has coordinates <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,-5\\sqrt2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-\\sqrt2,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,2\\sqrt2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\sqrt2,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.36-q11","number":11,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Write down the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\times2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> matrix that represents a stretch, parallel to the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis, scale factor 7, and a stretch, parallel to the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis, scale factor 3.</p></li><li><p>The point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2m+n,n-m)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is transformed by the matrix in a) to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(18n+1,m-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find the values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"m\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}7&amp;0\\\\0&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}7&amp;0\\\\0&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2m+n\\\n-m\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}18n+1\\\\m-1\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}14m+7n\\\\3n-3m\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}18n+1\\\\m-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"14m+7n=18n+1\\Rightarrow14m-11n=1\\quad(1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3n-3m=m-1\\Rightarrow4m-3n=1\\quad(2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>  <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore m=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.36-q12","number":12,"question":"<p>The point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A(-2,8)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is enlarged, centred at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B(2,-6)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, by scale factor 3. Find the coordinates of the image of the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{BA}=\\overrightarrow{OA}-\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\begin{pmatrix}-2\\\\8\\end{pmatrix}-\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\-6\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-4\\\\14\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;0\\\\0&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-4\\\\14\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-12\\\\42\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{OA\\prime}=\\overrightarrow{OB}+\\begin{pmatrix}-12\\\\42\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\-6\\end{pmatrix}+\\begin{pmatrix}-12\\\\42\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-10\\\\36\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.  So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\\prime(-10,36)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.36-q13","number":13,"question":"<p>The point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A'(10,-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is the image of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> after it is enlarged, centred at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B(-8,-3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, by scale factor <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{10}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find the coordinates of the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{BA\\prime}=\\overrightarrow{OA\\prime}-\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\begin{pmatrix}10\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}-\\begin{pmatrix}-8\\\\-3\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}18\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}10&amp;0\\\\0&amp;10\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}18\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}180\\\\20\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\overrightarrow{OB}+\\begin{pmatrix}180\\\\20\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-8\\\\-3\\end{pmatrix}+\\begin{pmatrix}180\\\\20\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}172\\\\17\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.  So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A(172,17)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]}]